        "created_at": "2014-08-24T05:35:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've got this same question up on <a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1219453/wraith-vs-tachyon-are-impossible-attacks-resolved\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Boardgame Geek's forums</a>. The answers are confusing there too. The wording does make it sound like it resolves as a miss. You could even rationalize it as a sonic boom after effect of Tachyon's attack.</p><p>I'd love an official word on this.</p>",
