        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/d2c977/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-26T16:55:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The question, as I understand it, is what happens if Tachyon targets a 1 hp Wraith with Sucker Punch, and Wraith uses Slip into Shadows in response?<br><br>Possibilities:<br>1)&nbsp; The attack misses but still resolves, therefore Wraith is incapacitated.<br>2)&nbsp; Because the attack is now \"impossible,\" it no longer resolves at all and Wraith is still active at 1 hp.<br><br>There's no apparent agreement among fans/playtesters as to what was intended, so a more \"official\" answer would be nice.</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:46:41.216Z",
